        "collapsible_tab_mjEF8T": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Chizel™?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>You're getting a chewing gum built to do one thing: <strong>load the muscle that shapes your jawline</strong>. It's 15x harder than normal gum, so your jaw actually has to work.</p><ul><li>Your masseter finally gets trained: real resistance, like a weight for your face</li><li>You do it anywhere: at your desk, in the gym, before bed, 15 minutes a day</li><li>Nothing your dentist would frown at: sugar-free, no aspartame, 100% vegan</li><li>You feel the work, not a chore: fresh, intense taste plus B-vitamins (B3, B5, B6, B12)</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_gBgAbF": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you need it",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>You train your chest, your arms, your abs. And then you leave the one muscle that frames your entire face completely untouched.</p><p>Your jawline sits on top of the <strong>masseter</strong>, one of the strongest muscles in your body. Like any muscle, it grows when you load it, and it softens when you don't. Normal gum is far too soft to load anything.</p><p>Chizel™ is 15x harder, so every chew is a rep. No needles, no filler, no surgery. Just progressive overload for your jaw.</p><p><strong>You already know how to build a muscle. This is the one you've been skipping.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_akEwJj": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits ✨",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>✓ <strong>Sharpen the muscle under your jawline</strong>: 15x-harder gum loads the masseter like a weight</p><p>✓ <strong>Train it anywhere</strong>: desk, gym, or before bed, 15 minutes a day, every other day</p><p>✓ <strong>Skip the needles</strong>: a defined jaw the natural way, no filler and no surgery</p><p>✓ <strong>Chew clean</strong>: sugar-free, no aspartame, 100% vegan, with B-vitamins for the work</p><p>✓ <strong>Actually enjoy it</strong>: fresh, intense mint or strawberry, as good as normal gum</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_MTCgw9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use it (15 minutes a day)",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>1.</strong> Pick your level: 1 piece to start, 2 for intermediate, 3 for an intense session.</p><p><strong>2.</strong> Chew 15 minutes to 1 hour, every other day. Like any muscle, your jaw needs rest to grow.</p><p><strong>3.</strong> Be consistent. The mirror moves on constancy, not on one hard session.</p><p>Stop if you feel jaw pain and give the joint time. Not for under 14. Results vary with training, sleep, and diet.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_FPPE7p": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer a guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Yes: <strong>30 days, money back.</strong></p><p>Train with it for a month. If your jaw doesn't feel stronger and you don't like the routine, send it back and we refund every cent.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
