    "collapsible_content_TCEeNz": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_kP7dka": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can you really train your jawline?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Your jawline sits on the <strong>masseter</strong>, a real muscle. Medical literature notes that heavy, repeated chewing (even bruxism) can enlarge it, which is muscle growth from load. Like any muscle, work it and it responds. Results vary with training, sleep, and diet.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jgAFHc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it bad for my teeth or jaw?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Chizel™ is <strong>sugar-free, no aspartame, and vegan</strong>, so there's no cavity risk from sweeteners, and chewing boosts saliva that protects enamel. That said, it's a workout: respect the joint. Chew <strong>15 minutes to an hour, every other day</strong>, and stop if you feel jaw pain. Not for under 14.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qUEDkw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fast will I see a difference?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Like the gym, the first sessions bring soreness, then adaptation. Reviewers tend to notice firmer definition around <strong>weeks 3 to 6</strong> of every-other-day training. It's slow because it's real muscle, and the first 30 days are covered by the guarantee.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_FCYENr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is this different from normal gum?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>It's 15x harder.</strong> Normal gum is far too soft to load a muscle, which is why chewing it your whole life changed nothing. Chizel™ gives your jaw real resistance, so every chew is a rep.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JXE9KX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much do I chew, and which level?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Three levels: <strong>1 piece (beginner), 2 (intermediate), 3 (expert)</strong>. Chew 15 minutes to an hour, every other day. Your jaw needs rest days to grow, exactly like any muscle. Mint or strawberry, your choice.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xwHJdL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping and returns?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Free tracked shipping.</strong> Allow the delivery window shown at checkout. And you're covered: <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong>, simple return, full refund.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
